# [SCHC](../wg/schc.html)

## Summary

The SCHC (Static Context Header Compression) working group met at IETF 127 in San Francisco and online. The session focused on reviewing working group document statuses and milestones, discussing core updates to universal options, ICMPv6 compression, dynamic rule management, YANG data model evolution, SCHC fragmentation with ARQ/FEC capabilities, integration of SCHC into 6G cellular architectures, and the VOICI minimal multiplexer header.

